      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "**Research Question:** How do Bayesian Logistic Regression and Neural Networks compare with traditional machine learning methods in detecting fraudulent healthcare insurance claims, and can Genetic Algorithm-based feature selection improve their predictive performance?"
      ],
      
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
